AirBridge follow-up to the four AirCANnect SPI SD patches through 2b8a8442.
Local safety fixes: reject uncertain CMD6 retries, validate every mounted
capacity, clean up failed mounts, and require accepted single-write tokens.
Data-response values follow the SanDisk SD Card Product Manual, section 5.18.6.

